{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107048","id":2560725256,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6YoZEI","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107048","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107048.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107048.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107048","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107048/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107048/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107048/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0538b8d0cb510cbf2a38730ffe42c6a9ab52230b","number":107048,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"iOS: Replace deprecated `UIScreen.main.scale` with `UITraitCollection.current.displayScale`","user":{"login":"atsed","id":26405854,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDA1ODU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26405854?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed","html_url":"https://github.com/atsed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atsed/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\n\r\nReplaces deprecated [`[UIScreen mainScreen].scale`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uiscreen/main?language=objc)  \r\nwith [`[UITraitCollection currentTraitCollection].displayScale`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uitraitcollection/displayscale?language=objc)  \r\nin `DisplayServerIOS::screen_get_scale`.\r\n\r\nThis change ensures forward compatibility with iOS versions beyond 18.5, where `UIScreen.mainScreen` is deprecated.\r\n\r\n### Implementation details\r\n\r\n- Falls back to `UIScreen.mainScreen.scale` on iOS versions prior to 13.\r\n- Uses `MAX(..., 1.0)` to preserve the original behavior of ensuring a minimum scale of 1.\r\n\r\n### Tested on\r\n\r\n- iPhone 16 Pro Max (iOS 18.5)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ak